  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>Welcome to 30A Beach Music, a luxury multi-level coastal retreat managed by Bonheur Vacations, ideally located on the south side of 30A just steps from the sugar-white sands of Seagrove Beach. With Gulf views, a private pool, and generous living space, this home is perfectly suited for large families and groups seeking both comfort and convenience in the heart of 30A.<br><br>Designed for entertaining and relaxation, the home features two spacious living rooms and two fully equipped kitchens, offering ample room for gathering while still allowing privacy across multiple levels. Step outside to enjoy the private outdoor space, ideal for unwinding after a day at the beach. Optional pool heating is available seasonally for an additional fee.<br><br>Guests enjoy easy access to a private deeded beach entrance, located approximately 100 yards from the home and adjacent to One Seagrove public beach access. Included bikes and a golf cart make exploring Seagrove and nearby 30A communities effortless, including Seaside, Alys Beach, and Rosemary Beach.<br><br>Seagrove Beach is one of 30A’s most charming and centrally located communities, offering walkable restaurants such as Surfing Deer and Market Café. A short bike ride west brings you to Seaside’s iconic town center with shops, farmers markets, and dining, while riding east leads to The Big Chill, a popular outdoor entertainment hub with restaurants, games, and big-screen TVs. For guests seeking adventure beyond the shoreline, 30A is uniquely positioned between the Gulf of Mexico and a 15,000-acre coastal forest featuring hiking and off-road trails.<br><br>Sleeping Accommodations<br><br>Bedroom 1: King, shared bathroom (1st floor)<br><br>Bedroom 2: Two Twin/Twin bunk beds, shared bathroom (1st floor)<br><br>Bedroom 3: King primary suite with ensuite bathroom (2nd floor)<br><br>Bedroom 4: King, shared bathroom (2nd floor)<br><br>Bedroom 5: Two Twin/Twin bunk beds, shared bathroom (2nd floor)<br><br>Bedroom 6: King, shared bathroom (3rd floor)<br><br>Property Features<br><br>Private pool (optional seasonal heat available for $50/day)<br><br>Gulf views<br><br>Golf cart<br><br>4 adult bikes<br><br>Two kitchens<br><br>Two living rooms<br><br>Shuffleboard table<br><br>Washer and dryer on 1st and 2nd floors<br><br>Gas grill<br><br>Fully stocked kitchens<br><br>Full linen package (bedding and towels)<br><br>Self check-in<br><br>Pet Policy<br><br>This home is pet friendly. A $250 non-refundable pet fee applies.<br><br>Parking<br><br>Parking is available for 4–5 vehicles, depending on vehicle size.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Beach Music Gorgeous 6 Bdrm, steps to beach, 6 seater golf cart, beach chairs"
        }
      ],
